  "body": "Elevate your view and your lifestyle with this freehold Kensington Park terraced home. Enjoy a coveted north-facing aspect overlooking a tranquil garden reserve, with sparkling sea views adding to the sense of serenity. The freehold title offers you the independence and financial benefits of home ownership, while you enjoy the resort-like amenities of the Kensington Park community, all within a short walk to the golden sands of Orewa Beach.  A rare bonus of this home is the double garage with side-by-side parking, offering excellent storage and convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three generous bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, while the master suite enjoys an elevated outlook across the reserve towards the sea. Quality finishes throughout reflect the premium lifestyle Kensington Park is renowned for.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\nThree spacious bedrooms\r\n* Two full bathrooms plus an additional w.c.\r\n* North-facing position with all-day sun\r\n* Overlooks landscaped garden reserve\r\n* Sea views\r\n* Double garage with side-by-side parking\r\n* Open-plan living and entertaining\r\n* Premium fixtures and finishes\r\n* No body corporate\r\n* Access to Kensington Park's luxury amenities, including heated indoor pool, gymnasium, sauna and beautifully maintained grounds\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking a permanent residence, a lock-and-leave retreat, or an investment in one of Orewa's most desirable communities, this exceptional home offers a lifestyle that is second to none.\r\n\r\nViewing is available today!  \r\nCall Jaimee now to chat about this special property.\r\n\r\nHarcourts Files: To view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/D52D",
